# {{ title }}

{{ description }}. A SLATECORE app by GENSLATE (Tauri 2 shell, React 19 UI, Rust core in
`crates/{{ name }}-core`).

```text
bun run dev {{ name }}          # native window with Vite hot reload
bun run dev {{ name }} --web    # the UI alone in a browser: http://localhost:{{ port }}
bun run build                   # production build of every app
```

- Window title and product name: `{{ title }}` (`src-tauri/tauri.conf.json`).
- Bundle identifier: `{{ identifier }}`.
- Vite port {{ port }} (HMR {{ port + 1 }}) must match `build.devUrl` in `src-tauri/tauri.conf.json`.
- Replace `src/assets/app-icon.svg`, then run `bun run tauri icon src/assets/app-icon.svg` here to
  regenerate `src-tauri/icons`.
- Tests: `bun test --preload ./tests/setup/dom.preload.ts` (happy-dom + Testing Library).
